"Replace ``image.FREAK`` with ``image.ORB``, drop the descriptor-type "
"argument, and update ``match_descriptor()`` tuple unpacking / "
"``draw_keypoints()`` to the keypoints object (:ref:`the ORB rework "
"<v2_1_0_orb>`)."
msgstr ""
"Substituir ``image.FREAK`` por ``image.ORB``\\ , eliminar o argumento de "
"tipo de descritor e atualizar o desempacotamento da tupla de "
"``match_descriptor()`` / ``draw_keypoints()`` para o objeto de pontos-chave "
"(\\ :ref:`a reformulação do ORB <v2_1_0_orb>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:218
msgid ""
"Rename ``sensor.set_whitebal()`` / ``set_gain_ctrl()`` / "
"``set_exposure_ctrl()`` to the ``set_auto_*`` forms (:ref:`the auto-function"
" rename <v2_1_0_autofuncs>`)."
msgstr ""
"Renomear ``sensor.set_whitebal()`` / ``set_gain_ctrl()`` / "
"``set_exposure_ctrl()`` para as formas ``set_auto_*`` (\\ :ref:`a renomeação"
" das funções automáticas <v2_1_0_autofuncs>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:221
msgid ""
"Move histogram/statistics code to the object methods (:ref:`the "
"histogram/statistics rework <v2_1_0_histogram>`)."
msgstr ""
"Mover o código de histograma/estatísticas para os métodos de objeto (\\ "
":ref:`a reformulação de histograma/estatísticas <v2_1_0_histogram>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:223
msgid ""
"Rename ``find_features()`` ``scale=`` to ``scale_factor=`` (:ref:`the "
"find_features rename <v2_1_0_findfeatures>`)."
msgstr ""
"Renomear ``scale=`` de ``find_features()`` para ``scale_factor=`` (\\ "
":ref:`a renomeação de find_features <v2_1_0_findfeatures>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:225
msgid ""
"Use blob-object accessors and replace ``find_markers()`` with "
"``find_blobs(merge=True, ...)`` (:ref:`the find_blobs change "
"<v2_1_0_findblobs>`); replace ``img.copy_to_fb()`` with the ``copy_to_fb=`` "
"keyword (:ref:`the copy_to_fb change <v2_1_0_copytofb>`)."
msgstr ""
"Usar os acessadores de objeto blob e substituir ``find_markers()`` por "
"``find_blobs(merge=True, ...)`` (\\ :ref:`a mudança em find_blobs "
"<v2_1_0_findblobs>`\\ ); substituir ``img.copy_to_fb()`` pela palavra-chave "
"``copy_to_fb=`` (\\ :ref:`a mudança em copy_to_fb <v2_1_0_copytofb>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:230
msgid ""
"Clamp ``compress()`` quality to 1–100 and re-check JPEG sizes on the OpenMV "
"3 (:ref:`the compress change <v2_1_0_compress>`); re-tune ``lens_corr()`` "
"zoom (:ref:`the lens_corr change <v2_1_0_lenscorr>`)."
msgstr ""
"Limitar a qualidade de ``compress()`` ao intervalo 1–100 e reverificar os "
"tamanhos JPEG no OpenMV 3 (\\ :ref:`a mudança em compress "
"<v2_1_0_compress>`\\ ); reajustar o zoom de ``lens_corr()`` (\\ :ref:`a "
"mudança em lens_corr <v2_1_0_lenscorr>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:234
msgid "All other scripts run unchanged."
msgstr "Todos os outros scripts funcionam sem alterações."
